  "notes": "{焦|こ}げる is an intransitive ichidan verb.\n\nTRANSITIVE/INTRANSITIVE PAIR:\n- {焦|こ}がす (transitive): to burn, to scorch\n- {焦|こ}げる (intransitive): to burn, to get scorched\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {焦|こ}げ{臭|にお}い (こげくさい): smelling of something burning\n- {焦|こ}げ{付|つ}く (こげつく): to burn and stick to the pan\n- おこげ: scorched rice at the bottom of the pot (sometimes desired)",
